  "synopsis": "In Japan during the height of its economic boom in the mid-1950s, the circus was a form of entertainment that became a central part of many people's lives. The best troupes are permitted to participate in the world-renowned \"Circus Collection\" festival, and many come from all over Japan to compete daily.\n\nThe story centers on the struggling \"Sunflower Circus\" troupe, led by ringmaster Maria, and a new prodigy that joins their ranks for unknown reasons: Mizuka Tsurumaki.\n\nIs her encounter with the highly individual members of the Sunflower Circus troupe a coincidence or destiny? This one-of-a-kind circus show depicting young girls chasing their dreams begins!\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)",
